SCP-9032.raw_source:
	=====

[[include <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/component:preview">:scp-wiki:component:preview</a>

text= SCP-9032 refers to a phenomenon that is related to the inability to perceive time normally.

]]

=====



[[include <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/theme:black-highlighter-theme">:scp-wiki:theme:black-highlighter-theme</a>]]

[[include <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/theme:minimalist-bhl">:scp-wiki:theme:minimalist-bhl</a>]]



[[module CSS]]

:root {

    --header-title: "APPLIED TEMPORAL DIVISION";

    --header-subtitle: "For the Transcendence of Humanity";

    --lgurl: url('https://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/chronesthesia-1/SCP_Time_logo.png');

    --header-h1-font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.8125rem);

    --header-h2-font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 3vw, 0.9375rem);

}



#header::before {

    background-size: auto calc(var(--header-height-on-desktop) - 0.5rem);

}



#header h1 a::before,

#header h2 span::before {

    display: none;

}



#header h1 a::after {

    line-height: 1.2;

text-shadow: 2px 2px #fff, 

-2px -2px #fff, 

0px 2px #fff, 

0px -2px #fff, 

2px 0px #fff, 

-2px 0px #fff, 

2px -2px #fff, 

-2px 2px #fff;

}



#header h2 span::after {

    margin-top: 10px;

text-shadow: 1px 1px #fff, 

-1px -1px #fff, 

0px 1px #fff, 

