**Special Containment Procedures:** Available resources are to be focused on securing SCP-9070 child instances.



By available means, normist organizations must be prevented from capturing any SCP-9070 child instance. Any suspected move to do so must be met with lethal interception.



**Description:** SCP-9070 was an explosion of thaumaturgic energy that originated from eastern Qeqqeta, Greenland at 11:23 UTC on the 26th of June, 2025. It expanded to an estimated radius of 200,000 to 350,000 kilometers from its point of origin and passed through most materials without resistance. It fully permeated through Earth at a point approximately 400-500 kilometers north of Concordia Station, Antarctica 1 minute and 32 seconds after its manifestation. 



SCP-9070's main anomalous property was the disappearance of and/or the complete neutralization of anomalous effects and objects it passed through for approximately 11 seconds on average. It remained undetected by non-anomalous measuring equipment.



As a result of this effect, several anomalous methods of containment and travel became irrevocably damaged and must be restored from their initial stages. It is currently poorly understood what causes anomalies to be temporarily disrupted as opposed to permanently. Examples of these include:



* Several standardized containment cells;

* Spatial fissures, artificial or otherwise;

* Memetic and antimemetic veiling thaumaturgy and technology.



The secondary effect was the creation of child instances, respectively known as SCP-9070-Alpha, -Beta, -Gamma, -Delta and -Epsilon, which manifested immediately upon SCP-9070's activation. These child instances were triangulated by Scranton Wave Disruptions[[footnote]] Often abbreviated as SWD, a Scranton Wave Disruption is the emission or transmission of anti-anomalous energy in the form of wave or particles moving through space or a material medium. It is typically emitted by Scranton Reality Anchors. [[/footnote]] detected by Foundation Hume biotechnical sensoriums on a global scale.



Each SCP-9070 child instance is engraved with a message written in Latin from an individual identifying themselves as "Contranumen". While the exact anomalous properties of these pillars are currently unknown, individuals who are A) equipped with paratechnology[[footnote]] Individuals with anomalous implants and prosthetics were affected, as well as individuals equipped with anomalous items.[[/footnote]] or B) possess anomalous properties[[footnote]] E.g. reality benders, thaumaturges. [[/footnote]] have reported difficulty concentrating in the sites' proximity.



**UPDATE:** SCP-9070's child instances can be manipulated by Exacratus[[footnote]] Designation referring to phenomena colloquially known as "curses". [[/footnote]]-class thaumaturges to obtain True Normalcy. Due to this, the Recordkeeping and Information Security Administration (RAISA) is currently deliberating upgrading SCP-9070 from Ekhi to Keneq Disruption Class.



-----



[[=]]

++ **Addendum 9070-0-1:** O5 Council meeting regarding SCP-9070

[[/=]]



[[=]]

//June 26th 2025 12:36 UTC[[footnote]] https://www.timeanddate.com/time/aboututc.html [[/footnote]]//

+++* 1 HOUR AND 13 MINUTES AFTER SCP-9070

[[/=]]



[[div class="file-class" style="background-color: #000000;color: #adadad;text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px #211d29;border: 3px outset #ffffff; padding:15px; margin-bottom: 10px;"]]

[[=image Conference_Room_Irvine_Tax_Solutions.jpg size="medium" style="border-style: simple; border-width: 3px; border-color: #c1c1c1"]]



[[div style="margin-top: -20px"]]

[[=]]

^^//Site-01 O5 Council primary meeting room prior to the destruction caused in the wake of SCP-9070.//^^

[[/=]]

[[/div]]



**FOREWORD:** The following emergency meeting has been made available to all personnel with Security Clearance 3 and above in the interest of securing coherent and quick action. Audio and video were recorded through [[span class="o5 o5-6" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-6[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Singularity[[/span]][[/span]] due to a lack of recording equipment in the O5 Command Room.



------



**In attendance:** [[span class="o5 o5-2" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-2[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Lieutenant[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-5" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-5[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Shadow[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-6" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-6[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Singularity[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-11" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-11[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Butcher[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-13" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-13[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Analyst[[/span]][[/span]]. 

**Absent with clarity:** [[span class="o5 o5-1" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]][[span class="o5 o5-1" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-1[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Anomaly[[/span]][[/span]][[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Anomaly[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-3" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-3[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Physicist[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-7" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-7[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Chemist[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-8" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-8[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Biologist[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-9" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-9[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Rocker[[/span]][[/span]].

**Absent without clarity:** [[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]][[footnote]] Last known location is Sisimiut, Greenland. It is assumed that [[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]] is alive and well due to his proficiency with thaumaturgy in combat. [[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]] has recently formed MTF Alpha-24 "Four Hands", who is assumed to be contributing to [[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]]'s safety. [[/footnote]], [[span class="o5 o5-10" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-10[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Summoner[[/span]][[/span]][[footnote]] Last known location is New York City, United States of America. [[span class="o5 o5-10" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-10[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Summoner[[/span]][[/span]] is assumed to be located in her personal safehouse, although her current condition is unknown. [[/footnote]], [[span class="o5 o5-12" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-12[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Consul[[/span]][[/span]][[footnote]] Last known location is unknown. [[span class="o5 o5-12" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-12[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Consul[[/span]][[/span]] has been attending personal matters for the past 43 days. [[/footnote]]



------



//<[[span class="o5 o5-2" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-2[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Lieutenant[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-5" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-5[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Shadow[[/span]][[/span]], [[span class="o5 o5-6" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-6[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Singularity[[/span]][[/span]] and [[span class="o5 o5-13" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-13[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Analyst[[/span]][[/span]] are seated in their respective seats. [[span class="o5 o5-11" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-11[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Butcher[[/span]][[/span]] forcefully enters the room and slams the door behind him. He leaves behind traces of blood on the door.>//



**[[span class="o5 o5-11" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-11[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Butcher[[/span]][[/span]]:** Alright, seems like good old Site-01 is burned. Concealing paratech failed, like anything else.



//<[[span class="o5 o5-11" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-11[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Butcher[[/span]][[/span]] takes off his blazer and tosses it into the corner of the room. The antimemetic effect that hides [[span class="o5 o5-11" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-11[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Butcher[[/span]][[/span]]'s appearance//

[[footnote]] Through implants, all Overseers' appearance can be antimemetically modified so that their exact features cannot be distinguished. Due to the Shrouded Sheperds Act, an Overseer's identity and appearance must be hidden, including from other Overseers. [[/footnote]] //is nullified for the blazer as it leaves the effective range. It is visibly covered in blood.>//



