**FOREWORD:** Captured on surveillance equipment recently installed by [[span class="o5 o5-5" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-5[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Shadow[[/span]][[/span]]'s personal task force, Alpha-25 "Shadow Wizards M.G." in Dakar, Senegal.



-----



//<The camera is positioned to have an overview of an alleyway with a suspected Way[[footnote]] A portal often used to gain entrance to and from the Wanderer's Library, but can lead to other locales if they are connected to another Way. [[/footnote]] used by Serpent's Hand operatives. A middle-aged white male wearing an open, plain green robe runs through the alley armed with a wand in each hand. This individual is suspected to be Jas Weißenwrachz and will be referred to as such in the transcript. A red, thin projectile is shot down the alley and hits a protective barrier around Weißenwrachz.>//



