//<Bestial screaming.>//



**[[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]]:** As I was saying, I apologize for the hectic situation. We're stuck at sea and had to go through desperate measures to obtain contact. There are unholy, red-scaled beasts out here. I am not quite sure of their origin, but they seem to be capable of creating an anomalous space to trap my--...



**Sgt. de Toulouse:** Rijae, did you animate the harpoon?!



**Pvt. Joshi:** Negative, fish must've done it!



**[[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]]:** Associates and I.



//<A loud crash is heard, presumably the mast falling into the water. It is followed by a seemingly celebratory roar from an undefined source.>//



