**[[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]]:** Mastless vessel. We will try to survive and then retreat, but we will not be ready for conflict even if we make it to Dakar in time. It'd seem that the bullets are--?



