**[[span class="o5 o5-4" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-4[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Warlock[[/span]][[/span]]:** Damned. Not to mention the fatigue of my exceptional bodyguards. It is my suggestion that we try to make amends with whatever Groups of Interest may be in Brazil to secure the Amazonas pillar.



