+++* 6 DAYS, 8 HOURS AND 11 MINUTES AFTER SCP-9070

[[/=]]



[[div style="border:solid 3px; padding:15px; margin-bottom: 10px;"]]



**FOREWORD:** Following their departure from Antarctica, Sgt. Vestergaard and Dr. Wrenna spent 5 hours and 21 minutes on transit to Dakar. Their mode of transportation are a pair of Malum-class[[footnote]] Designation for sentient extradimensional entities with traditionally hostile or malevolent intent towards humanity. Demons, revenants and ███████ screamers have traditionally been filed as Malum-class. The designation is currently under deliberation due to its established prejudicial nature. [[/footnote]] entities manifested by [[span class="o5 o5-10" tabindex="0"]][[span class="main"]]O5-10[[/span]][[span class="alt"]]The Summoner[[/span]][[/span]], respectively known as Afrastella Maskmaker and Tarel'ka the Gilded to the Foundation. 



**<BEGIN LOG>**



//<Sgt. Vestergaard is held up by his arms inbetween Afrastella Maskmaker's talons. He is wearing a Hawai'ian shirt and cargo shorts. His eyes are covered by round shades.>//



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]You're quite the delightful, doubtful morsel... shame I cannot weave you into my empire.[[/span]]



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** Doubtful? Perhaps I'm simply concerned about being held by some freaky pterodactyl's claws.



//<Sgt. Vestergaard looks off to the side towards the horizon and smiles thinly.>//



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]I do not believe it to be my grip alone that constrains you. You feel... burdensome.[[/span]]



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** Yeah, that'd be the seared penguin I indulged myself in back there in Snowland-- do you have to talk or do you know when to quiet down?



//<Afrastella Maskmaker huffs in an amused manner.>//



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]As is your bidding.[[/span]]



//<Tarel'ka the Gilded, who carries Dr. Wrenna on his back, moves closer tp Afrastella Maskmaker and Sgt. Vestergaard.>//



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]I AM UTTERLY CONVINCED THAT IT'S A SHAKEDOWN. THE REAL VALUE LIES IN PRECIOUS MATERIALS, FOR GOLD OUTLASTS EMPIRES. THE MOMENT YOURS FALL, SO WILL THE HOARD IT MAINTAINS. I'VE HEARD THERE'S A LAKE ON ONE OF YOUR CONTI--[[/span]]



**Dr. Wrenna:** Sorry, man. But I get it, alright? Don't buy stocks, buy gold. How do you even have awareness of how mortal economy works when you spend most of your time in the Dusk?



//<Tarel'ka the Gilded bobs his head from left to right in deliberation. He circles his claws idly as he does. Dr. Wrenna tries his best to stay on his draconic horns.>//



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]WE ARE ABLE TO SEE INTO YOUR PLANE THROUGH NAMES. IMAGINE THAT YOU'RE BLIND, YOU STAND IN A DARK ROOM. YOU MIGHT BE ABLE TO HEAR VOICES, BUT WHEN THE NAME OF YOUR MASTER OR YOURSELF IS SPOK--[[/span]]



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** Look, wyvern. Please. I don't care. We probably have this documented somewhere, George.



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]A-HA? DID THAT DECEITFUL WITCH ALREADY ATTACH STRINGS TO YOU? HAVE YOU BECOME A PUPPET FOR HER TO SPREAD CHICANERY THROUGH YOU? I WOULDN'T TRUST THOSE //BHERRHIR// FIE--[[/span]]



//<Sgt. Vestergaard draws his sidearm and discharges it towards Tarel'ka the Gilded 5 times. The projectiles ricochets off the green scales into the ocean below.>//



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]FINE, FINE. YOU MORTALS AND YOUR EXCESS OF EMOTION. I'LL STAY QUIET.[[/span]]



//<Afrastella Maskmaker snickers.>//



**Dr. Wrenna:** You seem... off. Is it about Fournier?



//<Sgt. Vestergaard takes a deep breath and holsters his firearm.>//



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** She was just another woman. No.



**Dr. Wrenna:** Certainly didn't look at her like just another woman. Or whisper to her. Or--



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** She's dead and gone.



//<Dr. Wrenna scoffs.>//



**Dr. Wrenna:** Yeah, but the important parts are preserved, right? Did you use X-ray vision to inspect Test Six's heart rate or something back at the Pillar?



//<Sgt. Vestergaard rolls his eyes, he remains quiet.>//



**Dr. Wrenna:** Can't help but notice--



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** How about you keep your notice on the task ahead, okay? I'm not in the mood for this introspective pseudoscience you people do nowadays.



//<Dr. Wrenna frowns. He nods slowly and looks ahead with a puzzled expression. Afrastella Maskmaker snickers once more.>//



...



**[6 MINUTES AND 23 SECONDS CUT FOR BREVITY.]**



...



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]Human.[[/span]]



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** What now?



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]There's land in sight.[[/span]]



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** And?



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]A magical bolt of power are headed our way. It's quite adeptly cast, I do believe that the spell is designed to certainly make impact with a target. That means either both of us go down, or you do.[[/span]]



//<Sgt. Vestergaard squints his eyes. In the far distance, the drone is able to pick up on thaumaturgic signatures.>//



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]WHAT IF I BLOCK IT? MY SCALES, MADE MAGNIFICENT BY GOLD AND SILVER, COULD SURELY TAKE IT.[[/span]]



**Dr. Wrenna:** My anomaly could neutralize it too, I reckon?



//<The thaumaturgic signatures are 200 meters away and rapidly approaching.>//



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]No, no. It was cast on the human and I specifically, you were not close enough. You do not have the contour like he and I do. It would simply warp around and find a path.[[/span]]



**Dr. Wrenna:** That's-- God, why didn't I participate in those counter-thaumaturgy seminars--



//<The thaumaturgic signatures are 150 meters away.>//



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** If it hits me, can you hold onto me? Through the impact?



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]I'm uncertain. I cannot wield magic in this form to ensure it.[[/span]]



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]HOW //ADORABLE//. MAGIC BEING INVALIDATED BY UTTERLY MUNDANE CIRCUMSTANCES.[[/span]]



//<100 meters away.>//



**Dr. Wrenna:** Damn it, dragon! We don't have time for this! What do we do?



//<The group falls silent.>//



**Dr. Wrenna:** Thorstein!?



//<50 meters.>//



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** When that mess gets close, toss me into it. I'll catch up.



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]Are you certain?[[/span]]



**Dr. Wrenna:** Wha--



**Sgt. Vestergaard:** Thoroughly. Need you to take care of George, ain't good in new circumstances.



//<25.>//



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]As you bid.[[/span]]



//<Afrastella Maskmaker launches Sgt. Vestergaard forwards into the incoming red missile. Sgt. Vestergaard immediately expires and erupts into an estimated 30-40 pieces. The body parts descend into the ocean, approximately 41 kilometers from the coastline.>//



**Dr. Wrenna:** Wh-- what the fuck?



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]Quite curious one.[[/span]]



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]HUH. WONDER IF I CAN BUY THAT MORTAL, HE SEEMS QUITE VALUABLE.[[/span]]



//<Dr. Wrenna sighs and rubs his eyebrows.>//



**Dr. Wrenna:** Great. Now I'm a man down, in the middle of Foundation-hostile territory and need to somehow enable the Serpent's Hand to secure the pillar.



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]GOOD THING YOU HAVE US. OUR WORTH CANNOT BE STATED IN YOUR LANGUAGES.[[/span]]



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]I have little interest in breaking the contract with The Conjurer. You will have my assistance 'til I turn to Dusk once more.[[/span]]



**Dr. Wrenna:** J-- just swell.



////<Dr. Wrenna narrows his eyes and looks down at the ocean. Sgt. Vestergaard's remains are starting to make impact with the ocean.>////



**Dr. Wrenna:** This better not be another one of his schemes...



**Tarel'ka the Gilded:** [[span class="demonG"]]HEY, AT THE VERY LEAST HE MIGHT BRING US SOME FISH ON THE WAY.[[/span]]



////<Dr. Wrenna sighs and rubs his eyebrows.>////



**Afrastella Maskmaker:** [[span class="demonB"]]Curious magic. Someone is quite skilled at metamagic down there, to have hit us from this range and with such a specialized blast. I am starting to believe there'll be an abundance of opportunities to collect knowledge here.[[/span]]



**<END LOG>**



