This protocol is to be declared active by unanimous decision of the Overseer Council when, and exclusively when, the containment of SCP-9120 is considered irreversibly compromised and the occurrence of one or more K-Class Scenario(s) becomes imminent. The following steps are to be taken to ensure the continuation of the human race as a species.



* The sitting Director of Area-400 is to issue an immediate evacuation order for all non-essential personnel. The evacuation window will be limited to ten (10) minutes.

* SCP-9120-D is to be contacted and, if feasible, extracted from SCP-9120-B if it has not yet been neutralized.

* All members of ATF Theta-99 are to attempt to close SCP-9120-A by any means necessary.

* The deployment of Gen-3 Scranton Reality Anchors in conjunction with industrial-grade Lonsdale Thaumaturgic Inhibition Field Generators, all of which are located in the High-Security Storage wing of Area-400, is authorized to seal SCP-9120-A and/or prevent further connections between SCP-9120-B and baseline reality from being formed.

* The Overseer Council will formally declare a state of global emergency.

* All allied governments and Groups of Interest are to be notified of the situation and briefed through all appropriate secure channels.

* The Emerging Threat Response Department (ETRD) will assume operational command and coordinate all countermeasures against EoI-001 should it breach into baseline reality.

* The use of all available assets, including conventional, experimental, and anomalous weaponry, as well as SCP objects currently in Foundation custody, is authorized in the engagement against EoI-001.



Should the steps outlined in this document fail to halt or neutralize EoI-001, it will constitute the ultimate failure of the Foundation’s core threefold mission. In such an event, the Overseer Council will formally announce the dissolution of the SCP Foundation, and all personnel will be relieved of their duties effective immediately.

